# Lumenhold Academy — 简体中文 (zh-CN) translation of content/events/calendar_2b.grim
# Maintained by `node tools/grim.js i18n zh-CN`. Translate the text after "="; keep {tokens}.
# "# en:" shows the English source. [hash] marks the English version a line was translated from;
# lines marked STALE need updating — after fixing the text, delete the [hash] and re-run the tool.


@event enrolment
# en: Enrolment
title [cbadef] = 选课
# en: {term_index == 1: Your first term. The registrar slides a list across the desk: four courses open to first-years.|A new term, and a new list. Courses you've passed are gone from it; new levels have appeared.} Choose two. Course fees are ten crowns.
text [2d80c6] = {term_index == 1: 你的第一个学期。教务员把一张清单推过桌面：四门对一年级开放的课。|新学期，新清单。你已通过的课不见了，新的级别冒了出来。}选两门。课程费十克朗。
# en: The registrar's hall at the start of term, students queueing at long tables with course lists that rewrite themselves.
scene [6d30e9] = 开学时的教务大厅，学生们在长桌前排队，手里的课程表会自己改写。
# en: Take no courses this term
opt.none.label [679a29] = 这学期不选课
# en: Allowed. Your GPA will not thank you.
opt.none.hint [362aa4] = 可以。你的 GPA 不会感谢你。

@event club_fair_v3
# en: The Club Fair
title [ce4fee] = 社团招新会
# en: The Club Fair fills the courtyard. Every table wants you; every captain swears theirs is the one that matters. {rel(lyra) >= 10: Lyra is at the Duelling Circle's table, pretending not to watch which way you walk.|}
text [0746ce] = 社团招新会挤满了庭院。每张桌子都想要你，每位社长都发誓自家才是最要紧的。{rel(lyra) >= 10: 莱拉站在决斗社的桌边，假装没在看你往哪儿走。|}
# en: The courtyard full of recruiting tables, banners snapping, a duelling demonstration drawing a crowd.
scene [72616b] = 庭院里摆满招新桌，旗帜猎猎作响，一场决斗示范引来一圈围观者。
# en: Not this year
opt.none.label [594ecf] = 今年算了
# en: You can join at next year's fair.
opt.none.hint [2bec0b] = 明年的招新会还能加入。

@event job_board_visit
# en: The Job Board
title [377c1b] = 招工告示板
# en: Notices for work, three layers deep: the library, the Gilded Newt, Pell & Daughters, the courier loft. Each wants someone reliable. Each says so twice.
text [358cb2] = 招工启事叠了三层：图书馆、镀金蝾螈酒馆、佩尔父女药铺、信使阁楼。每家都要个靠得住的人，每家都说了两遍。
# en: A cork board crowded with notices, a student running a finger down a column of shift times.
scene [62cc7b] = 一块挤满告示的软木板，一名学生用手指顺着一列排班时间往下划。
# en: Just looking
opt.look.label [4af612] = 只是看看
# en: Hand in your notice
opt.quit.label [e9edc6] = 递交辞呈
# en: You can find work again later.
opt.quit.hint [974ede] = 以后还能再找工作。
# en: You hand in your notice. Your evenings are yours again; so is your empty purse.
opt.quit.say.1 [3dd0ab] = 你递交了辞呈。晚上又归你自己了，空荡荡的钱袋也是。

@event break_plan
# en: The Break
title [e3e693] = 假期
# en: {month == 5: The winter break.|The summer break.} Two months without lectures. The castle empties, mostly.
text [78e780] = {month == 5: 冬假。|暑假。}两个月没有课。城堡几乎空了。
# en: The academy gates thrown open, barges loading trunks, a few students lingering on the steps with nowhere they'd rather be.
scene [003006] = 学院大门敞开，驳船装着行李箱，几个学生在台阶上逗留，哪儿也不想去。
# en: Stay at the castle
opt.castle.label [04365a] = 留在城堡
# en: Quiet corridors and secrets. Board 6 crowns a month.
opt.castle.hint [b21ac5] = 安静的走廊和秘密。每月食宿 6 克朗。
# en: The castle in the holidays is a different building: louder echoes, kinder staff, doors you've never seen open.
opt.castle.say.1 [f9e1bd] = 假期里的城堡是另一座建筑：回声更响，职员更和气，还有你从没见开过的门。
# en: Go home
opt.home.label [c93952] = 回家
# en: Family, old friends, free board.
opt.home.hint [1bbb35] = 家人、老朋友、免费食宿。
# en: The barge, the coach, the last mile on foot. Home is smaller than you remember, and warmer.
opt.home.say.1 [0b9342] = 驳船、马车，最后一里路靠双脚。家比记忆中小，也比记忆中暖。
# en: Work full-time
opt.work.label [02d5b1] = 全职打工
# en: Extra shifts at double pay.
opt.work.hint [155d60] = 加班，双倍工钱。
# en: You trade the holidays for wages. Your feet will remember it.
opt.work.say.1 [e054a1] = 你用假期换了工钱。你的脚会记住这一切。
# en: Start your internship
opt.intern.label [744abc] = 开始实习
# en: A stipend, a supervisor and a project.
opt.intern.hint [abd74b] = 一份津贴、一位导师和一个课题。
# en: You pack a trunk of notebooks and take the long coach to the capital.
opt.intern.say.1 [9f079a] = 你装了一箱笔记本，坐上去王都的长途马车。

@event track_warning
# en: A Word About Your Attendance
title [6bd5a3] = 关于你的出勤
# en: A note about {track}: your attendance and your efforts have slipped, and it has been noticed. One more term like this and there will be consequences.
text [2da6ae] = 一张关于{track}的便条：你的出勤和努力都在下滑，有人注意到了。再这样一个学期，就要有后果了。
# en: A folded note on official paper, the words "performance" and "concern" underlined twice.
scene [7cac89] = 一张折起来的公文纸，“表现”和“关切”两个词下面各划了两道线。
# en: Promise to do better
opt.left.label [cba502] = 保证会改进
# en: You write back a promise in your neatest hand. Now you'll have to keep it.
opt.left.say.1 [5983e6] = 你用最工整的字回了一份保证。现在你得兑现它了。
# en: Let it slide
opt.right.label [344baa] = 随它去
# en: You put the note in a drawer. It doesn't stop existing in the drawer.
opt.right.say.1 [7973f8] = 你把便条塞进抽屉。它在抽屉里也照样存在。

@event track_promotion
# en: A Step Up
title [39f03f] = 更上一层
# en: {track} wants to promote you. More responsibility, more respect, and in the right places, more pay.
text [a932cb] = {track}想提拔你。更多责任，更多尊重，在某些地方，还有更多薪水。
# en: A small ceremony in a cramped room, someone pinning a badge to a student's collar while the others applaud.
scene [c03b55] = 狭小房间里的一场小仪式，有人把徽章别在一名学生的领口上，其他人鼓掌。
# en: Accept
opt.left.label [b26149] = 接受
# en: The badge is a little crooked. You don't straighten it.
opt.left.say.1 [7c4086] = 徽章有点歪。你没去扶正它。
# en: Not yet
opt.right.label [8dd27c] = 还不是时候
# en: "When you're ready, then." They mean it. The offer will come again.
opt.right.say.1 [ffa0ad] = “那就等你准备好。”他们是认真的。这个机会还会再来。

@event intern_application
# en: Applications Open
title [e7df06] = 开始申请
# en: The Royal Library is taking summer researchers. The notice wants a GPA of 2.5, Astromancy at the second level, and "a genuine love of indexes".
text [935010] = 皇家图书馆在招暑期研究员。告示要求 GPA 2.5、星象学二级，以及“对索引的真挚热爱”。
# en: A notice with a royal seal pinned above all the others: summer research posts at the Royal Library.
scene [8cd4f2] = 一张盖着王室印章的告示钉在所有告示之上：皇家图书馆暑期研究职位。
# en: Apply
opt.left.label [77bbdb] = 申请
# en: You write the letter three times. The third is good. You send the second by mistake. It's fine.
opt.left.say.1 [451213] = 你把信写了三遍。第三遍写得很好。你错寄了第二遍。没关系。
# en: Not this year
opt.right.label [594ecf] = 今年算了
# en: You let the notice flap. There's always next year, until there isn't.
opt.right.say.1 [d2e703] = 你任告示在风里扑腾。总还有明年，直到没有明年。

@event intern_offer
# en: A Letter From the Royal Library
title [7077cb] = 皇家图书馆来信
# en: {gpa >= 2.5 and level(astromancy) >= 2: The Royal Library is pleased to offer you a summer research post.|The Royal Library regrets: the post has gone to a candidate with stronger marks.}
text [971023] = {gpa >= 2.5 and level(astromancy) >= 2: 皇家图书馆很高兴为你提供一个暑期研究职位。|皇家图书馆深表遗憾：该职位已给了成绩更好的候选人。}
# en: A heavy envelope with a royal seal on a dormitory desk.
scene [d9ce04] = 宿舍书桌上一只盖着王室印章的厚信封。
# en: Accept
opt.left.label [b26149] = 接受
# en: You read the letter until the seal cracks. A summer in the oldest archives in the realm.
opt.left.say.1 [173a81] = 你把信读到封蜡都裂了。在王国最古老的档案馆里度过一整个夏天。
# en: Fold the letter away
opt.right.label [81ff5f] = 把信折起来收好
# en: You fold it carefully. Next year, perhaps.
opt.right.say.1 [e28348] = 你仔细折好它。也许明年吧。

@event thesis_setup
# en: Choosing a Thesis
title [ed9c10] = 选定论文
# en: Next year is your final year, and it comes with a thesis. Professor Thorne has three topics ready, at three levels of ambition.
text [c744eb] = 明年是你的最后一年，还附带一篇毕业论文。索恩教授准备了三个题目，野心各不相同。
# en: A professor's study, three topic proposals laid out on the desk like cards.
scene [82a455] = 教授的书房，三份选题提案像纸牌一样摊在桌上。
# en: A careful survey
opt.safe.label [d4d296] = 一篇稳妥的综述
# en: Easier, and it will read as easier.
opt.safe.hint [8d81c3] = 更容易，读起来也会显得更容易。
# en: A sensible topic. Thorne says "Sensible," the way other people say "Disappointing."
opt.safe.say.1 [5a3672] = 一个明智的题目。索恩说“明智”的语气，就像别人说“失望”。
# en: An original study
opt.solid.label [0d9f34] = 一项原创研究
# en: The usual path.
opt.solid.hint [8adec9] = 寻常的路。
# en: Thorne nods. "Good. Bring me something I don't already know."
opt.solid.say.1 [9feb76] = 索恩点点头。“好。给我带来点我还不知道的东西。”
# en: Something no one has done
opt.ambitious.label [326da2] = 前无古人的课题
# en: Harder, and worth more.
opt.ambitious.hint [83c12d] = 更难，也更有分量。
# en: Thorne is quiet for a long time. "Hm," he says, and for once it sounds like hope.
opt.ambitious.say.1 [18b887] = 索恩沉默了很久。“嗯，”他说，这一次听起来竟像是希望。

@event thesis_defence
# en: The Defence
title [3a2f48] = 答辩
# en: Three examiners, one lectern, and a year of work. {progress(thesis) >= 60: You know this material better than anyone in the room.|There are gaps, and you know where they are.}
text [b6b3ea] = 三位考官，一座讲台，一年的心血。{progress(thesis) >= 60: 这些内容你比屋里任何人都熟。|有漏洞，而且你知道它们在哪儿。}
# en: A semicircular table with three examiners, a student standing at a lectern with a stack of notes.
scene [f8606f] = 半圆形的长桌后坐着三位考官，一名学生站在讲台前，手里一摞笔记。
# en: Defend it
opt.left.label [0249ce] = 为它辩护
# en: They stop asking questions and start asking for copies. Distinction.
opt.left.say.1 [e3c797] = 他们不再提问，开始讨要副本。优等。
# en: A pass, with one examiner's handwriting all over your conclusion.
opt.left.say.2 [4ad614] = 通过了，只是结论部分写满了某位考官的批注。
# en: They send you away to resubmit. It isn't the end. It feels like it.
opt.left.say.3 [b2d4d0] = 他们让你回去重交。这不是终点。只是感觉像。

@event lantern_night_v3
# en: Lantern Night
title [0b1f19] = 灯笼夜
# en: Lantern Night. The whole academy gathers on the lakeshore with paper lanterns, each carrying a wish out over the water. {month == 2 and year == 1: Your first one.|Another year, another wish.}
text [b3014a] = 灯笼夜。全院的人带着纸灯笼聚在湖岸，每盏灯都载着一个愿望飘向水面。{month == 2 and year == 1: 这是你的第一次。|又一年，又一个愿望。}
# en: The Mirror Lake at night, hundreds of paper lanterns drifting over the water, students crowding the shore.
scene [cd9b4c] = 夜晚的镜湖，数百盏纸灯笼在水面上漂，学生们挤满湖岸。
# en: Wish for something selfish
opt.left.label [7e0393] = 许一个自私的愿望
# en: Your lantern goes out over the water and keeps its secret. You feel lighter for having asked.
opt.left.say.1 [0210ff] = 你的灯笼飘向湖面，守着它的秘密。问出口之后，你觉得轻松了些。
# en: Wish for someone else
opt.right.label [bc6686] = 为别人许愿
# en: You don't tell anyone who. The lantern seems to know; it flies straight.
opt.right.say.1 [00b286] = 你没告诉任何人是谁。灯笼似乎知道，它飞得笔直。

@event year_four
# en: The Final Year
title [a30775] = 最后一年
# en: The barge again, the towers again, and a thesis waiting. Final year. The first-years on the deck look at you the way you once looked at the fourth-years.
text [b5589b] = 又是驳船，又是高塔，还有一篇论文在等着。最后一年。甲板上的一年级生看你的眼神，就像你当年看四年级生那样。
# en: The seven towers at dawn from the barge, the same view as the first day, but the student watching it has changed.
scene [542188] = 从驳船上望见的黎明七塔，和第一天的景色一样，但看风景的学生已经变了。
# en: Here we go
opt.ok.label [e1aa95] = 走吧
# en: You know which steps creak. You know which doors stick. One more year to learn the rest.
opt.ok.say.1 [e1f039] = 你知道哪级台阶会响，哪扇门会卡。还有一年，去学剩下的。
